-- The whole of Algeria is open for orders (owner's decision, Oct 2026: "all of Algeria as a country"). The area is the
-- country's border (Natural Earth 1:50m, public domain) widened by 5 km so no coastal or border address falls outside a
-- simplified line. Every delivery stays local because of the longest-trip limit (max_km, 50 km by default).
-- Staff can still close it or add smaller zones. If a zone named "Algérie" already exists (e.g. the rectangle from the
-- console), it takes this shape and is opened.
